"details":"See the locations tab for more information about venue locations","coordinates":{"latitude":-15.834535,"longitude":-56.206054}},"information":"![](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/rails\/active_storage\/blobs\/redirect\/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBc0p4IiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--4df491991667c56a97cc89fc14cf8fa2503be18b\/CS%202024%20RBK%20WCA_vertical%20logo.png)\n\n*English:*\n\u200b\nThis competition will hold **only 3x3x3 Fewest Moves event**, and it will be held in multiple locations, across South America. Please pay attention to the **date and time zone** of your [location](#42267-lugares-locations)!\n\u200b\nLocations may be added until the 16th of June 23:59UTC so if there isn't a location near you yet contact your local [Delegate](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/delegates#latin-america) in South America.\n\u200b\n---\n\u200b\n*Espa\u00f1ol:*\n\u200b\nEsta competencia tendr\u00e1 **solo el evento 3x3x3 Menos Movimientos**, y se llevar\u00e1 a cabo en m\u00faltiples ubicaciones en Am\u00e9rica del Sur. \u00a1Preste atenci\u00f3n a la **fecha y zona horaria** de su [ubicaci\u00f3n](#42267-lugares-locations)!\n\u200b\nSe pueden agregar ubicaciones hasta el 16 de junio a las 23:59 UTC, por lo que si a\u00fan no hay una ubicaci\u00f3n cerca de usted, comun\u00edquese con su [Delegado](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/delegates#latin-america) local en Am\u00e9rica del Sur.\n\u200b\n---\n\u200b\n*Portugu\u00eas:*\n\u200b\nEsta competi\u00e7\u00e3o contar\u00e1 **apenas com a modalidade 3x3x3 Menos Movimentos** e ser\u00e1 realizada em v\u00e1rios locais da Am\u00e9rica do Sul. Preste aten\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 **data e fuso hor\u00e1rio** da sua [localidade](#42267-lugares-locations)!\n\u200b\nOs locais podem ser adicionados at\u00e9 16 de junho \u00e0s 23h59 UTC, portanto, se ainda n\u00e3o houver um local pr\u00f3ximo a voc\u00ea, entre em contato com o [Delegado](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/delegates#latin-america) local na Am\u00e9rica do Sul.","externalWebsite":null,"region":"south-america"},{"id":"SAC2022","name":"Rubik's WCA South American Championship 2022","city":"Bras\u00edlia, Distrito Federal","country":"BR","date":{"from":"2022-07-22","till":"2022-07-24","numberOfDays":3},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333fm","333mbf","333oh","444","444bf","555","555bf","666","777","clock","minx","pyram","skewb","sq1"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Cristian Ezequiel Vega","email":"cvega@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Dennis Rosero","email":"drosero@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Gabriel Silva dos Santos","email":"gsantos@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Guido Dipietro","email":"gdipietro@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Guilherme Santana Campos","email":"gsantanacampos7@gmail.com"},{"name":"Heron Sato","email":"hsato@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Hevelyn Sato","email":"hsato1@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Jo\u00e3o Vin\u00edcius Santos","email":"jvinicius@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Jos\u00e9 Antonio Gaete Rozas-Pe\u00f1a","email":"jgaete@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Marlon de V. Marques","email":"mmarques@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Pedro Miranda Moreira","email":"pmiranda@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Pedro Santos Guimar\u00e3es","email":"pguimaraes@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Renan da Cunha Santos","email":"renan.cunha20@gmail.com"}],"organisers":[{"name":"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Brasileira de Cubo M\u00e1gico (ABRACM)","email":"contato@abracm.org.br"},{"name":"Sarah Strong","email":"sstrong@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"venue":{"name":"[Parlamundi](https:\/\/fenixeventosdf.com.br\/)","address":"Setor de Grandes \u00c1reas Sul 915, Lotes 75\/76","details":"","coordinates":{"latitude":-15.823553,"longitude":-47.92964}},"information":"![](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/rails\/active_storage\/blobs\/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBcjBXIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--41fcf